<title>USA: Hills Stores names Doyle treasurer.</title>
<headline>Hills Stores names Doyle treasurer.</headline>
<dateline>CANTON, Mass. 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hills Stores Co said on Monday John Doyle Jr. has joined the company as vice president - treasurer.</p>
<p>Doyle was most recently vice president and treasurer of Carson Pirie Scott &amp; Co, Hills said.</p>
<p>Doyle reports to C. Scott Litten, executive vice president and chief financial officer, Hills said.</p>
<p>It could not immediately be determined who preceded Doyle at this post or if it was newly created.</p>
